  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add curly endive and cook until slightly wilted, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add white wine and cook until the liquid has reduced by half, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add currants and cook until they start to soften, about 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add tortellini, nutritional yeast, and a pinch of salt and pepper. Toss to combine.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the oven and bake at 375°F until crispy and golden brown, about 10-12 minutes.",
    "Garnish with lemon zest and additional curly endive if desired.",
    "Toss with additional currants and pine nuts if desired."
  ],
